    "created_at": "2016-08-17T13:47:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-17T13:47:25Z",
    "body": "> There's no need for export on `<h4>`?\n\nAccording to https://github.com/tabatkins/bikeshed/blob/master/docs/dfn-contract.md, \"If neither is provided, `dfn` type definitions default to noexport, while all others default to export\".\n",
